{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02421","headline":"召拜御史大夫赠袁天纲 · 杜淹","name":"召拜御史大夫赠袁天纲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊吕深可慕，松乔定是虚。\n系风终不得，脱屣欲安如。\n且珍纨素美，当与薜萝疎。\n既逢杨得意，非复久闲居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜淹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}